        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>世界气候类型的分布</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = {\n      tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$'], ['\\\\(', '\\\\)']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$'], ['\\\\[', '\\\\]']] },\n      svg: { fontCache: 'global' }\n    };\n  </script>\n  <script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-svg.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    html,\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n      background: #ffffff;\n      color: #333333;\n      font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    }\n\n    .page {\n      width: 680px;\n      min-height: 900px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 58px 68px 38px;\n      position: relative;\n      background: #fff;\n    }\n\n    h1 {\n      margin: 0 0 12px;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      line-height: 1.3;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: #222;\n    }\n\n    .intro {\n      margin: 0 0 10px;\n      padding-left: 22px;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      line-height: 1.75;\n      text-align: left;\n      text-indent: 0;\n    }\n\n    .highlight {\n      background: #f6bd79;\n      border-radius: 3px;\n      padding: 0 2px;\n    }\n\n    .figure-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n      column-gap: 28px;\n      row-gap: 16px;\n      margin-top: 7px;\n    }\n\n    figure {\n      margin: 0;\n      width: 100%;\n    }\n\n    .placeholder {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 166px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      border: 1px solid #d8d8d8;\n      background: #eef0ed;\n      color: #777;\n      font-family: \"SimSun\", serif;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n\n    .forest {\n      background:\n        linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(34, 60, 32, .82), rgba(135, 154, 119, .58)),\n        repeating-linear-gradient(115deg, #607653 0 10px, #263d29 11px 20px);\n    }\n\n    .grassland {\n      background:\n        linear-gradient(to bottom, #77a7c6 0 54%, #c8b66a 55% 73%, #c39b49 74%);\n    }\n\n    .temperate {\n      background:\n        linear-gradient(115deg, rgba(113, 72, 34, .65), rgba(203, 153, 76, .6)),\n        repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, #3d5a35 0 7px, #9c742d 8px 15px);\n    }\n\n    .polar {\n      background:\n        linear-gradient(to bottom, #185e83 0 17%, #f4f7f6 18% 27%, #77a9c6 28% 42%, #f9fbfa 43% 57%, #9fc9df 58% 73%, #f5f8f7 74%);\n    }\n\n    figcaption {\n      margin-top: 5px;\n      min-height: 58px;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      line-height: 1.55;\n      text-align: left;\n      color: #444;\n    }\n\n    .marker {\n      color: #15945d;\n      font-family: sans-serif;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      margin-right: 2px;\n    }\n\n    .caption-highlight {\n      background: #f7bd78;\n      border-radius: 3px;\n      padding: 0 1px;\n    }\n\n    .figure-label {\n      margin: 2px 0 0;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      line-height: 1.5;\n      color: #555;\n    }\n\n    .closing {\n      width: 300px;\n      margin: 24px 0 0 auto;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      line-height: 1.75;\n      text-align: left;\n      text-indent: 2em;\n    }\n\n    .footer {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 68px;\n      right: 68px;\n      bottom: 39px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 17px;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      color: #555;\n    }\n\n    .page-number {\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n      font-size: 12px;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <h1>世界气候类型的分布</h1>\n\n    <p class=\"intro\">\n      虽然世界的气候复杂多样（图3.27），但是它们的分布有一定规律。例如，\n      <span class=\"highlight\">由赤道向两极地区，有规律地分布着热带的、亚热带的、温带的和寒带的气候</span>。\n      不同的气候类型呈现出不同的自然景观。\n    </p>\n\n    <section class=\"figure-grid\" aria-label=\"四种气候类型的自然景观\">\n      <figure>\n        <div class=\"placeholder forest\">[照片：左上]</div>\n        <figcaption>\n          <span class=\"marker\">●</span>\n          <span class=\"caption-highlight\">热带雨林气候主要分布在赤道附近地区。</span>\n          这里全年高温多雨，植物终年常绿，许多地方分布着茂密的热带雨林。\n        </figcaption>\n      </figure>\n\n      <figure>\n        <div class=\"placeholder grassland\">[照片：右上]</div>\n        <figcaption>\n          <span class=\"marker\">●</span>\n          <span class=\"caption-highlight\">热带草原气候主要分布在热带雨林气候的南北两侧。</span>\n          这里全年高温，分干湿两季，旱季的草木枯黄，地面上树木稀疏，长着较高的草。\n        </figcaption>\n      </figure>\n\n      <figure>\n        <div class=\"placeholder temperate\">[照片：左下]</div>\n        <figcaption>\n          <span class=\"marker\">●</span>\n          <span class=\"caption-highlight\">温带季风气候主要分布在温带大陆东部。</span>\n          这里四季分明，夏季高温多雨，冬季寒冷干燥，生长着落叶阔叶林。\n        </figcaption>\n      </figure>\n\n      <figure>\n        <div class=\"placeholder polar\">[照片：右下]</div>\n        <figcaption>\n          <span class=\"marker\">●</span>\n          <span class=\"caption-highlight\">极地气候主要分布在极圈以内，大部分地区终年寒冷。</span>\n          地面被冰雪覆盖，植被稀少。\n        </figcaption>\n      </figure>\n    </section>\n\n    <p class=\"figure-label\">图3.27 四种气候类型的自然景观</p>\n\n    <p class=\"closing\">\n      其中，热带的气候大致分布在南、北回归线之间，寒带的气候大致分布在北、南极圈内，亚热带和温带的气候大致分布在北回归线与北极圈之间、南回归线与南极圈之间。在中纬度地区，由大陆东岸、大陆西岸向大陆内部，气候类型的分布也是有规律的。\n    </p>\n\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n      <span class=\"page-number\">64</span>\n      <span>第二章&nbsp;&nbsp;天气与气候</span>\n    </footer>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
